".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-OCA%2Fmanufacture-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/OCA/manufacture/tree/20.0/mrp_repack\n"
"    :alt: OCA/manufacture\n"
".. |badge4| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/weblate-Translate%20me-F47D42.png\n"
"    :target: https://translation.odoo-community.org/projects/manufacture-20-0/manufacture-20-0-mrp_repack\n"
"    :alt: Translate me on Weblate\n"
".. |badge5| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/runboat-Try%20me-875A7B.png\n"
"    :target: https://runboat.odoo-community.org/builds?repo=OCA/manufacture&target_branch=20.0\n"
"    :alt: Try me on Runboat\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"This module repacks a product with manufacturing orders that consume the\n"
"product they produce, so the time spent repacking adds to its cost. It\n"
"is meant for products weighed and packed again, e.g. bulk product put in\n"
"packages of variable weight, without creating a second product for the\n"
"packed one.\n"
"\n"
"A bill of materials cannot have its product as component, so repacking\n"
"orders have no bill of materials: they get the product as component and\n"
"an operation in the repacking work center when they are confirmed. The\n"
"operation time is valued at the cost per hour of the work center and\n"
"added to the value of the repacked product. The lot of the order is\n"
"consumed and produced again, so repacking keeps the lot.\n"
"\n"
"Odoo computes the average cost replaying the moves in order, and the\n"
"moves of a manufacturing order are done at the same time, so this module\n"
"makes sure the consumption is valued before the production. Otherwise\n"
"the cost of the operation would be spread over the stock both before and\n"
"after repacking.\n"
"\n"
".. IMPORTANT::\n"
"   This is an alpha version, the data model and design can change at any time without warning.\n"
"   Only for development or testing purpose, do not use in production.\n"
"   `More details on development status <https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status>`_\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Create a manufacturing operation type for repacking and, in its\n"
"*Repacking* section:\n"
"\n"
"- Tick *Repacking*.\n"
"- Choose the *Repacking Work Center*, whose cost per hour values the\n"
"  time spent repacking.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"In *Inventory > Reporting > Stock by Location* (or any list of stock),\n"
"select the stock to repack and use the *Repack* action. A confirmed\n"
"repacking order is created for each line, with its lot to be produced\n"
"again.\n"
"\n"
"Start the operation of the order when repacking starts and finish it at\n"
"the end, set the quantity produced (or capture it by weighing with\n"
"``mrp_capture``) and mark the order as done.\n"
"\n"
"A repacking order can also be created by hand with a repacking operation\n"
"type: the product is added as component when it is confirmed.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/manufacture/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/manufacture/issues/new?body=module:%20mrp_repack%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
